Subject: [PATCH 6/7] fix(rfork): adapt v0.26.0rc1 APIs

Resolve hardware-profile access through a lazy legacy fallback and map RFork MoE lifecycle contracts to the v0.26.0rc1 fused_moe implementation. Preserve the rc1 MoE counter during failed-load rollback and keep focused compatibility coverage.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
